# Telegraph Narrows (CIPlay telegraph_narrows; in the plan after Sorting Rock): quest "Down the Line"
# West headland (stack 1, 20 m) at -34 0 with the first hut, stacks 2-7 at x -20..20 (18..10 m), the east headland
# (stack 8, 7 m) at 34 0 with the last hut and Holger's cage.
island Telegraph Narrows
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Down the Line
zone first_hut
expect step 1
read Telegraph code sheet
expect step 2
use linehub
expect message line is dead
use generator
expect story linepower 1
expect step 3
zone stack_4
expect step 4
use linehub
expect story linewire 1
expect step 5
kill Screecher
expect animals Screecher 0
expect step 6
zone last_hut
expect step 7
open Telegraph cabinet
expect message locked
code cabinetpad 1111 wrong
code cabinetpad 7241
open Telegraph cabinet
wait 3
expect item Blueprint_WindTurbine 1
expect item Blueprint_BatteryAdvanced 1
expect item Blueprint_HeadLight_Advanced 1
expect item Blueprint_ElectricGrill 1
expect step 13
# POST 10-26: the hub, Dagny Ek, the climb, Seal Cave, the secrets
expect hidden qt_rewchest
use qt_machine
expect hidden qt_rewchest
read Repeater notice
expect step 14
use Dagny Ek
wait 1
expect step 15
expect hidden qt_lampchest
use Line lamp 1
use Line lamp 2
wait 1
expect shown qt_lampchest
open Dagny's line book
zone qt_trail
expect step 16
zone qt_summit
expect step 17
open Repeater mast deck box
wait 3
expect story qt_top 1
expect step 18
zone qt_cave
expect step 19
open Seal Cave chest
wait 3
expect story qt_cave 1
expect step 20
use qt_machine
expect shown qt_rewchest
expect story qt_fixed 1
open Line repeater reward
wait 3
read Repeater tape
expect step 21
# the secrets: the plane, the jumps, the set, the telescope
zone qt_plane
open Line plane's crate
read Line patrol log
zone qt_jumps
open Pole climb
open Top of the pole stack
expect hidden qt_setchest
use qt_piece1
use qt_piece2
use qt_piece3
use qt_piece4
use qt_piece5
wait 2
expect shown qt_setchest
open Insulator crate
use qt_scope
wait 8
open Holger's kit
expect message still in the cage
use holgercage
expect survivor lastpost_holger
open Holger's kit
expect done
